  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Your familial line consisted of Pterodian vesperan. You have a wider wingspan than your other vesperan cousins, and you might have a mantle of fur around your neck and chest. You also have a longer snout with a sharper nose, and eyes accustomed to seeing in the dark. You gain darkvision, and when you roll a saving throw against inhaled threats and olfactory effects, you get the outcome of one degree of success better. You also gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Seek checks involving scent.</span></p>"
